# MSBuild output
build/
*.user
*.aps

# Visual Studio local state
.vs/
*.VC.db
*.VC.VC.opendb

# n8ro-sim-local writes a per-entity JSONL dump into ./test_artifacts relative to its
# working directory, unasked. Hundreds of MB per run. See notes.md.
test_artifacts/

# Standalone probe builds
*.exe
*.obj
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.idb

# Source documents supplied to the project, not produced by it. The client brief [S1] is
# the outer contract this work must comply with; docs/prd.md carries the detailed musts.
# Deliberately untracked: it is a proprietary binary and its content is Arkheon's, not ours.
*.docx

# Capture files produced by real runs. A full reference run of Atacama Air Defense is about
# 64 MB of JSON Lines - an artifact to produce and check, not one to version. The evidence
# pack carries a trimmed sample instead (see the un-ignore below), and README's "Reproducing
# the evidence" says how to make a full one.
captures/
*.n8rocap.jsonl
build.log
buildtests.log

# n8ro-sim-local, run from the repo root rather than a scratch directory, drops a copy of the
# schema database and a logger file into its working directory. Run artifacts, never ours.
data/
logs/

# ...except the evidence pack's sample capture, which is a deliverable (BTB-DOC-2). It is a
# real capture from a real run, trimmed by tests/evidence/trim_capture.py to two entities'
# samples with every structural record kept, and it still reports CONFORMS. The unit suites
# run against it, so it is test input as well as evidence.
!docs/sample-capture/
!docs/sample-capture/*.n8rocap.jsonl
